 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t a reliable, objective “best” lawyer for every car accident case. Based on the available listings, **David M. Van Sant of Van Sant Law** is one Atlanta attorney worth including on your shortlist: he focuses on personal injury and car/truck accidents and has substantial client-review history. That’s a starting point, not an endorsement or guarantee of results.\n\nBefore choosing, speak with two or three attorneys and ask:\n- Who will personally handle my case?\n- How many cases like mine have you taken to trial?\n- What is the fee, and what case costs might I owe?\n- What would you do first, and what challenges do you see?\n\nYou can also use the **Atlanta Bar Association Lawyer Referral and Information Service** (404-521-0777) or the State Bar of Georgia’s lawyer directory. The State Bar notes that it does not endorse individual lawyers or guarantee referral-service participants.",
